+| INC-001 | PREMATURE_MERGE | 批次未 accept、ci 工种回执尚未产出时即合并 PR；premerge 门实测判 MERGE_BEFORE_CI_RECEIPT。 | `MERGE_BEFORE_CI_RECEIPT` | — | enforced |
