+| INC-009 | INTENTIONAL_BYPASS | 用 gh workflow run / workflow_dispatch 伪造「PR 通道绿」；真 PR 通道要求 run 的 event=pull_request。 | `CI_BYPASS_FORBIDDEN` | — | enforced |
